  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming Eastern Province through Adaptation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Rwanda, sustainable increase in household incomes for farmers and other private actors in agricultural value chains is the main objective of &lt;b&gt;the TREPAM&lt;/b&gt; project, Transforming Eastern Province through Adaptation and Mitigation. How can this be achieved? : (1) Empower, incentivise and strengthen the resilience of the local community to plan, restore, maintain, monitor and protect the drought-degraded land and landscapes in the Eastern Province of Rwanda; and (2) Provide ecosystem services through sustainable land management best practices and inclusive businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
